fact WorkItem(id: "WI-152", description: some(value: "scaland resync — proposals 025 + 031: proof / lemma / provides / structured-proof grammar. Add parser + IR support for `proof X by <tactic> end`, structured `proof X ... end` blocks (inner step rules + concluding `[using ...] by <tactic>` clause), `lemma` colocation block, `provides` block, and the `enum` keyword. Loader stores these as opaque KB facts; no witness checking, no proof discharge (those land in WI-157). Mirror references: tree-sitter-anthill/grammar.js (proof / provides / enum / lemma productions); rustland/anthill-core/src/parse/ir.rs (ProofBody::SingleTactic / Structured, ProofStep). Scaland-side targets: scaland/core/src/main/scala/anthill/parse/AnthillParser.scala (new productions), parse/IR.scala (ProofBody, ProofStep types), load/Loader.scala (opaque KB encoding — witness/state_hash fields default). Acceptance: sbt test green; ParserIntegrationTest cases parsing one structured-proof example from examples/webots-modelling/lf1/ plus stdlib/anthill/realization/witness.anthill."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "scaland-sbt-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-142"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "user", at: "2026-05-02T09:07:33Z"))
